# The build context for apps/*/Dockerfile is the repo root. Keep it small, and
# make sure no local secret can ever reach an image (docs/design/deployment.md §1).

# Secrets: every env file, including .env.example (images never read env files).
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Installed and built output: the image installs and builds for itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Not needed to build either app.
.git
.github
.husky
.notes
.vscode
.idea
docs
infra
scripts
compose.yaml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/.DS_Store
